# Cold outreach: real names and email addresses of 102 CT assignors.
# This repo is public. Keep it local.
outreach/

# Roster snapshots written by scripts/ca-import.mjs on every --write run.
# ~4MB each and one per import — 29 of them landed in a single commit on
# 2026-09-15 and put 147MB into .git. The safety net is the FILE on disk, not
# git history; these are meant to be local and disposable.
scripts/backup-referees-*.json
scripts/backup-*.bak

# Throwaway query/diagnostic scripts. Anything worth keeping gets a real name.
scripts/_tmp-*.mjs
scripts/_patch-*.mjs

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⛔ REFEREE PERSONAL DATA — NEVER IN THE REPO
# Found in the public repo on 2026-10-30: a 3,454-record roster snapshot and a
# 332-row export carrying names, emails, phones, HOME ADDRESSES, DATES OF BIRTH,
# GUARDIAN NAME/EMAIL/PHONE and VENMO HANDLES. Many of those referees are
# children. Moved to ANVIL PROJECTS/_private-backups/, off GitHub.
#
# ⚠️ The backup script writes into scripts/ by default, so without this a future
# run silently re-commits the whole roster.
scripts/backup-referees-*.json
**/backup-referees-*.json
**/Referees-Grid view.csv
**/Availability-Grid view.csv
_private-backups/
